{"id":"everyday6b-034","label":"stop:economics","verdict":"agree","proposed":null,"sentence":null,"spec":null,"reason":null,"note":"Also fits §5.6 (room to absorb a reduction); \"before the seasonal display stops paying for itself\" states a floor, so §5.5 is defensible."}
